@Integration.OrderService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002

### Создать заказ
POST {{Integration.OrderService_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Получить заказ
GET {{Integration.OrderService_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###
